From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 13:58:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] chore: cleanup dead AI-router duplicates, merge CI workflows,
 enable R8

- remove unused ai/AiRouter.kt, ai/router/DeepSeekProvider.kt, ai/router/AiConfig.kt
  (dead code left over from AiRouterFactory refactor; nothing referenced them,
  active path is ai/router/AiRouter.kt + ai/DeepSeekAiProvider.kt)
- remove .github/workflows/android-build.yml (exact subset of android.yml,
  was double-running CI on every push to feature/fuel-dispatcher-v1)
- enable isMinifyEnabled + isShrinkResources for release builds
- add app/proguard-rules.pro (was referenced by build.gradle.kts but missing
  from the repo; harmless while minify was off, would have failed the build
  once R8 was turned on)
